  "prefLabel": "We 104.01 Statutes Granting Authority",
  "priorExpiration": "1996-08-13",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 104.01 Statutes Granting Authority. RSA 482-B authorizes the water well board to regulate the construction of wells and installation of well pumps, to license water well contractors and well pump installers, to provide well records, to charge fees, to provide for penalties, and to adopt rules pertaining to the implementation of these mandates.\n\nSource. #2557, eff 12-27-83; ss by #4730, eff 1-15-90; ss by #4898, eff 8-13-90; EXPIRED: 8-13-96\n\nNew. #6448, eff 1-29-97; ss by #7306, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9177, eff 6-13-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
}
